SUMMARY:Happy Hour Shut Up & Write
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\nLet’s gather together to sh
 ut up\, write\, and enjoy a beverage or two. Afterwards\, stick around for
  impromptu conversation. ¡Salud!
